# WHAT EVERY VERCEL DEPLOYMENT UPLOADS - an ALLOWLIST since 2026-10-14. Gate: tools/deploy_payload.py --check.
#
# ★WHY AN ALLOWLIST (2026-10-14). Vercel emailed Ian twice (2026-09-29, 2026-10-13): the free team had used 75% of
# Deployment Storage (10 GB). Every deployment stores a full copy of what it uploads, and this file used to be a
# DENYLIST - it named the few trees someone remembered were dev-only and everything else shipped. Measured that day,
# each deployment uploaded 612.7 MB in 5,944 files: the live-walk evidence banks (250 MB), the critic and trajectory
# registries (128 MB), test-run logs (55 MB), 1,900 tool scripts, 787 migration and function files, 146 screenshots,
# 365 Markdown docs. The site a person loads is 19.5 MB of it. Production served all of it on request -
# /trajectory_registry.json, /banks/*.json, /tools/*.py, /supabase/config.toml and the roadmap .md answered 200 - so
# it was an exposure as well as the quota. A denylist only stops what someone remembered to name; the next
# registry joined the next deployment by default.
#
# So: ignore everything at the root, then re-include what the site serves. tools/deploy_payload.py walks every page,
# script, stylesheet, the service worker's precache list and the manifest, and fails if a file the site asks for is
# left out (a 404 in production), if a development artifact ships, or if the payload passes its budget. When a page
# starts fetching a new file, that gate names it and it is added below.
#
# Syntax is .gitignore's (the last matching rule wins; a file inside an excluded folder cannot be re-included, so a
# folder is re-included before its contents are filtered). Comments must sit on their own lines.

/*

# --- pages, scripts and styles at the root ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/*.html
!/*.html.md
!/*.js
!/*.css

# --- what the platform itself requests: the PWA, crawlers, the CDN config, the IndexNow key ---------------------------
!/manifest.json
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/llms.txt
!/favicon.ico
!/favicon.svg
!/vercel.json
# IndexNow verifies the site by fetching this key (tools/indexnow_submit.py names it as keyLocation)
!/ea75de4e1f4161c869d7a30bcbad9660.txt

# --- images the pages show ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/wh_analytics_clean.png
!/wh_home_clean.png
!/wh_pm_clean.png

# --- data the pages fetch at runtime (the founder dashboards, the report sender, the learn links) ----------------------
!/api_adoption_baseline.json
!/api_component_registry.json
!/au_adoption_baseline.json
!/au_component_registry.json
!/av_adoption_baseline.json
!/av_component_registry.json
!/companion_ab_results.json
!/companion_dim_baselines.json
!/companion_eval_scorecard.json
!/companion_optimization_proposals.json
!/component_adoption_baseline.json
!/component_purity_baseline.json
!/db_adoption_baseline.json
!/db_component_registry.json
!/design_component_registry.json
!/family_rubric_baseline.json
!/family_rubric_scoreboard.json
!/family_rubric_scoreboard.page.json
!/field_impact_preview.json
!/learn_links.json
!/report-sender-manifest.json
!/storage_key_registry.json
!/ufai-rubric-spec.json

# --- page folders -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/learn/
!/about/
!/feedback/
!/privacy-policy/
!/terms-of-service/
!/i18n/
!/vendor/

# --- brand images: only the ones a page shows (the rest are design sources) ---------------------------------------------
!/brand_assets/
/brand_assets/*
!/brand_assets/hezekiah-256.jpg
!/brand_assets/zaniah-256.jpg
!/brand_assets/og-social.png
!/brand_assets/workhive-logo-tight.png
!/brand_assets/workhive-logo-transparent.png
# the installed app's icons (manifest.json + nav-hub.js's apple-touch-icon, 2026-10-27)
!/brand_assets/apple-touch-icon-180.png
!/brand_assets/icon-192.png
!/brand_assets/icon-512.png
!/brand_assets/icon-512-maskable.png

# --- tools/ is the dev toolbox AND the 60 public calculators (tools/<slug>/index.html + its .md mirror) ------------------
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/*/
/tools/fixtures/
/tools/lib/
/tools/psql_probes/
/tools/vendor/
/tools/*/*
!/tools/*/index.html
!/tools/*/index.html.md

# --- root scripts no page loads: test batteries and survey runners -------------------------------------------------------
/analytics_correctness.js
/companion_battery.js
/companion_surface_battery.js
/journey_battery.js
/live-state-runner.js
/survey_ufai_rubric.js
/ufai_battery.js

# --- never pages, wherever they sit (2026-09-06; kept by name for deploy-root-hygiene) ------------------------------------
# netlify.toml has always declared the intent - "publish=. would serve them; force 404 them" - but the site is deployed
# on VERCEL, which reads neither netlify.toml nor _headers. /_fixtures/engineering-design-test.html answered 200 with
# the full page until this file was committed (2026-09-10: it had sat untracked for four days, and an untracked ignore
# file excludes nothing). Two dev tools' Jinja templates were served from subfolders too, one rendering a raw
# {{ supabase_url }}. All of these are inside "/*" above; they stay named so a future edit of the allowlist that
# re-includes their folder cannot quietly serve them again.
_fixtures/
*.backup.html
*.backup2.html
index-v3-test.html
.tmp/
.playwright-mcp/
test-data-seeder/
video_marketing_app/
remotion_scenes/
